/// Business Unit dimension for Ask Your Team survey reporting. Use BusinessUnitName for Business Unit (BU) selections and Platform for Management Entity reporting; BusinessSegment is a separate grouping. Retain inactive members for history. Reports control IncludeAYT eligibility. Measures retain UNATTRIBUTED in Full Business results while excluding it from organisational detail and subsets. These reporting rules are not row-level security.
